"controller resets. Set your power supply's amps (minus a bit) and Iridia dims only when a color "
"would go over it. The estimate assumes 60 mA per LED at full white."
msgstr "Un verre de vin rouge, merci. Je suis une baguette. Joyeux anniversaire."

